ch-suggests-the-victorians-repurposed-them-as-building-materials-180989427/</link><description>最近发现的档案记录表明，19 世纪末建造多佛城堡警官门扩建部分的工人重复使用了都铎时代桑当城堡的碎片</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 12:52:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/stones-from-one-of-henry-viiis-fortresses-spent-more-than-a-century-hidden-in-plain-sight-new-research-suggests-the-victorians-repurposed-them-as-building-materials-180989427/</guid></item><item><title>是什么引发了尼泊尔​​和西藏的毁灭性洪水？未来还会发生更多洪水吗？这是科学家迄今为止所知道的</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/what-triggered-the-devastating-floods-in-nepal-and-tibet-and-are-we-due-for-more-in-the-future-heres-what-scientists-know-so-far-180989426/</link><description>自然灾害研究人员怀疑，涉及冰川的山体滑坡引发了这一事件，他们表示，由于人为造成的气候变化，可能会发生更多事件</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:50:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/what-triggered-the-devastating-floods-in-nepal-and-tibet-and-are-we-due-for-more-in-the-future-heres-what-scientists-know-so-far-180989426/</guid></item><item><title>参观见证了英格兰最伟大剧变的古代人的数字重建面孔</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-the-digitally-reconstructed-face-of-an-ancient-man-who-witnessed-englands-greatest-upheaval-180989425/</link><description>这位所谓的“征服者”于 1079 年被埋葬在英国，此时距离征服者威廉统治仅十多年。研究人员最近分析了骨骼的 DNA 和牙齿，以更多地了解他</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:35:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-the-digitally-reconstructed-face-of-an-ancient-man-who-witnessed-englands-greatest-upheaval-180989425/</guid></item><item><title>挪威的一座新博物馆将游客带入鲸鱼的世界——从真人大小的逆戟鲸到沉浸式水下展览</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-new-museum-in-northern-norway-is-bringing-visitors-into-the-world-of-whales-from-life-size-orcas-to-immersive-underwater-exhibits-180989421/</link><description>The Whale 将于 2027 年开业，将通过艺术、讲故事、声音和建筑来探索鲸鱼的科学、行为、进化和文化历史</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 17:57:00 GMT</pubDate><gu